---
marp: true
paginate: true
style: |
  section {
    background: #0b1320;
    color: #f8fafc;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    padding: 64px;
  }
  h1 {
    color: #f8fafc;
    font-size: 42px;
    line-height: 1.12;
    max-width: 1000px;
  }
  .flow, .choice {
    color: #d7ff64;
    font-size: 44px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 90px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .flow span, .choice span {
    color: #7dd3fc;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .metric {
    color: #d7ff64;
    font-size: 116px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 70px 0 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .label, .price, .cta {
    color: #f8fafc;
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cta {
    color: #7dd3fc;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
---

# Leftover gives chefs a clear prep number that cuts waste.

<div class="flow">MORNING <span>→</span> PREP QUANTITY</div>

<!-- Leftover gives chefs a clear prep number that cuts waste. -->

---

# Every service starts with a quantity decision.

<div class="choice">TOO LITTLE <span>·</span> RIGHT AMOUNT <span>·</span> TOO MUCH</div>

<!-- Too little can disrupt service. Too much can become prep waste. -->

---

# The pilot reports 31% less prep waste.

<div class="metric">31%</div>
<div class="label">less prep waste</div>

<!-- Leftover has been piloted in fourteen restaurants. The reported result: prep waste is down thirty-one percent. NEEDS SOURCE: measurement period and methodology. -->

---

# Nine restaurants now pay €290 each month.

<div class="metric">9</div>
<div class="price">€290 / month</div>

<!-- Nine restaurants now pay two hundred and ninety euros per month. -->

---

# Leftover is raising €600,000.

<div class="metric">€600k</div>
<div class="cta">Book a diligence meeting next week</div>

<!-- We are raising six hundred thousand euros to grow from this base. Book a diligence meeting for next week, and let’s make every morning’s first number a better one. NEEDS SOURCE: use of funds and milestones. -->
